  "reasoning": "The defendant sold pirated optical discs (CDs) without the copyright holder's permission, for profit. This conduct constitutes illegal reproduction and distribution of copyrighted works, which under Chinese criminal law is defined as the crime of '侵犯著作权罪' (copyright infringement). No other crimes described in the facts (e.g., fraud, bribery, etc.) apply. Therefore the sole appropriate charge is 侵犯著作权罪.",
